    "name": "DIESELDOME: Oil & Blood",
    "steam_appid": 2354640,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DIESELDOME: Oil &amp; Blood is an FPS with <strong>movement shooter</strong> and <strong>survivors-like</strong> mechanics. In every run, you will create absurdly <strong>powerful builds</strong> against <strong>hordes of enemies</strong> while facing the judgment of the crowd. Prepare to shed some blood in an original Roman-punk universe!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME-BREAKING BUILDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be a petrol-powered berserker, shooting tens of homing bullets that explode, or a V8-powered auto-crossbow sniper that wall runs and slides their way through the hordes?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different playable characters, each with unique weapons, abilities, and <strong>progression trees.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 unique <strong>game-changing perks</strong> that can be synergized to devastate the Dome.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WIN THE CROWD, RULE THE DOME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crowd itself determines your fate in the DIESELDOME. While facing warriors warped by the Empire, utilize the combo system to impress the crowd and level up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skill trees, maps, and passive skills while taking <strong>randomly generated bets.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong>randomized events</strong> and goals, making every match a fresh, unique challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face over 10 abominations and <strong>bloodthirsty bosses</strong> with unique move sets. They say Caesar himself awaits those who become the ultimate gladiator.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PARKOUR OR PERISH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When in Rome, parkour like the Romans do. Thanks to modern Imperial technology, your body is an unstoppable V8-powered engine of flesh!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour your way to glory by <strong>wall-running, sliding, grapple-hooking, gliding, and more.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each run, <strong>the arena shifts</strong> as its machinery and platforms reconfigure into new challenges. If you\u2019ve got the skill, you can use them to traverse the Dome like an eagle!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DIESELDOME: Oil &amp; Blood is an FPS with <strong>movement shooter</strong> and <strong>survivors-like</strong> mechanics. In every run, you will create absurdly <strong>powerful builds</strong> against <strong>hordes of enemies</strong> while facing the judgment of the crowd. Prepare to shed some blood in an original Roman-punk universe!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME-BREAKING BUILDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be a petrol-powered berserker, shooting tens of homing bullets that explode, or a V8-powered auto-crossbow sniper that wall runs and slides their way through the hordes?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different playable characters, each with unique weapons, abilities, and <strong>progression trees.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 unique <strong>game-changing perks</strong> that can be synergized to devastate the Dome.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WIN THE CROWD, RULE THE DOME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crowd itself determines your fate in the DIESELDOME. While facing warriors warped by the Empire, utilize the combo system to impress the crowd and level up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skill trees, maps, and passive skills while taking <strong>randomly generated bets.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong>randomized events</strong> and goals, making every match a fresh, unique challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face over 10 abominations and <strong>bloodthirsty bosses</strong> with unique move sets. They say Caesar himself awaits those who become the ultimate gladiator.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PARKOUR OR PERISH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When in Rome, parkour like the Romans do. Thanks to modern Imperial technology, your body is an unstoppable V8-powered engine of flesh!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour your way to glory by <strong>wall-running, sliding, grapple-hooking, gliding, and more.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each run, <strong>the arena shifts</strong> as its machinery and platforms reconfigure into new challenges. If you\u2019ve got the skill, you can use them to traverse the Dome like an eagle!</p></li></ul>",
